Assessment of Heavy Metals Concentration and
Microbial Profile in Sudanese Carbonated Soft Drinks
and Beverages
Awad Mohammed Babeker 1 , Mohammed Bahreldin Hussein 2 , Hamid Elhadi Briema 3 , Abuzur Osman
