Characteristics
Discomfort ranging from mild to intense typically experienced just before or at the beginning of
menstrual bleeding.
Absence of menstruation for three months or longer.
Limited blood flow or shortened duration (less than two days).
Bleeding more than eight days.
Menstrual cycle duration less than 22 days or more than 35 days.
Headaches, bloating, stress, and anxiety.
